  message: "Fixed in PR #4167 (merged b6403f6669). Spec fingerprint definition corrected: was 'sha256(source_bytes)'; now documents the structural semantics (parse-subtree hash, shape+identifiers+literals, whitespace/comment-invariant), the hgfp2: scheme prefix + symbol_fingerprint_scheme tag, and the null conditions (no grammar, no parseable content, error subtree). Schema  description updated to match. The WGSL bare-hex second-algorithm population this item noted as ironic is also gone (producer-side stampings demolished in the same PR)."  # 1c54
